          "sha256": "15c6cf20938a0153120aabe75adde17604d6fe44f09b4cddcb9bf16191f3622e",
          "text": "HSWM is a persistent token-native macro-neural world model: LLM-executed function cells operate within an evolving Wolframian n-ary hypergraph whose H/W/A/F state plays the roles of living self-describing harness, executable world model, and outcome-bound continuous learner; Pi preserves constitutional boundaries. This is target identity, not demonstrated efficacy.",
          "total_chars": 367,
          "truncated": false
        },
        {
          "encoding": "text",
          "next_offset": null,
          "offset": 0,
          "property": "user_canon",
          "sha256": "c67f915d4c2b6c648fa7b116dad662f4f80a0c80dcec141de9145d2bb2bbf267",
          "text": "HSWM은 LLM token으로 활성화되는 거시 신경망이며, 능동적으로 변하는 자기기술적 living harness의 역할과 Wolframian evolving-hypergraph world model의 역할을 동시에 수행하고, outcome-bound continuous learning으로 자신의 W/routing/H를 바꾸는 하나의 지속적 인지 객체다.",
          "total_chars": 200,
          "truncated": false
        }
      ],
